---

---

<section
  id="inicio"
  class="relative flex min-h-[760px] items-center overflow-hidden px-[clamp(28px,8vw,130px)] pt-[150px] pb-[84px] text-white max-[900px]:min-h-[700px] max-[900px]:pt-[135px] max-[620px]:min-h-[720px] max-[620px]:px-[22px] max-[620px]:pt-[135px] max-[620px]:pb-[80px] bg-[url('/images/portada.webp')] bg-no-repeat bg-cover bg-position-[75%_0] lg:bg-position-[60%_0]"
>
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] hidden bg-black/45 max-[620px]:block"></div>

  <div class="relative z-[2] max-w-[710px]">
    <p
      class="mb-[26px] flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/76"
    >
      <span class="h-px w-[34px] bg-gold"></span>
      La Biblia católica a la luz del Año Litúrgico
    </p>
    <h1
      class="m-0 font-serif text-[clamp(50px,6vw,82px)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.045em] font-normal max-[620px]:text-[46px]"
    >
      Una pausa para escuchar.<br />
      <em class="font-normal not-italic text-[#e0c295]"
        >Un camino para vivir.</em
      >
    </h1>
    <p
      class="my-[28px] max-w-[550px] font-serif text-lg leading-[1.7] text-white/77 max-[620px]:text-base"
    >
      Cada día, una reflexión para encontrarte con la Palabra de Dios y llevarla
      contigo a la vida cotidiana.
    </p>
    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8 max-[620px]:flex-col max-[620px]:items-start max-[620px]:gap-4"
    >
      <a
        href="#episodio"
        class="inline-flex min-h-[52px] items-center justify-center gap-[10px] rounded-[2px] bg-gold px-[25px] text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white transition-transform duration-150 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <span class="text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
        Escuchar el episodio de hoy
      </a>
      <a
        href="#podcast"
        class="border-b border-white/42 py-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.04em] text-white"
      >
        Ver todos los episodios <span class="ml-1.5 text-gold">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute bottom-[38px] left-[clamp(28px,8vw,130px)] z-[2] flex items-center gap-3 text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/48 max-[620px]:left-[22px]"
  >
    <span
      class="relative flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/35"
    >
      <span class="text-gold">↓</span>
    </span>
    Camina un poco más
  </div>
</section>
